From: Treggat <taggert2222@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:13:54 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 18/27] sycl : chunked (WY) gated-delta-net kernel for prefill

GGML_SYCL_GDN_CHUNKED=1 (default off; _MIN default 128 tokens): chunk-64
delta-rule with the intra-chunk (I+A)^-1 by forward substitution and an
inter-chunk state recurrence, f32 throughout. Keeps the snapshot, fused
cache and state-gather contracts; falls back to the sequential kernel
otherwise. ~3.2x per layer at 2048 tokens, rel err ~2.5e-7 vs the CPU
reference; model KL at 4k identical to the sequential path.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
